## Correlation Analysis

A correlation matrix was created to examine the relationship between the variables.

The analysis shows a negative correlation of approximately **-0.33 between Age and Spending Score**, while the relationship between Annual Income and Spending Score is very weak. :contentReference[oaicite:2]{index=2}

## Decision Tree Modelling

A Decision Tree model was used to analyse spending score based on:

- Age
- Annual Income
- Gender

The model was evaluated using Mean Squared Error and R-squared. :contentReference[oaicite:3]{index=3}

